{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "28a0a2c0-34da-8843-8078-4c7a0a10e18b",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T12:50:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Amara Cohen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:48:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:48:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good afternoon. Um, I'm calling about my recycling bin. It got left at the curb with a tag on it saying it was rejected. [pause] Sorry, you're on speaker, I'm in the kitchen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:48:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I can hear you okay. A rejected tag, so they didn't empty it. Do you remember what the tag said was the problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:48:41-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, let me see. I have it right here somewhere. Okay, it's a little orange tag, and it says contaminated, and there's a box checked for, um, bags. Plastic bags. So I guess I had bagged stuff in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:48:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's a common one. Loose items only in the recycling, no bagged materials. So what do you need, just to know for next week, or is the bin itself damaged?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:49:05-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, well, actually, the bin is gone. I mean, not gone gone. Hold on. The lid cracked when I dragged it back, so I want a replacement. Or, hmm, maybe I just want a new lid? Can you do just a lid?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:49:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can put in a request for a replacement bin, and you can mention the lid in the notes. Let me get your address first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:49:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 284 Bellevue Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:49:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "284 Bellevue. Got it. And a name for the request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:49:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Amara Cohen. C-O-H-E-N. Sorry, one second, I'm still wearing my headset from a work call, I keep forgetting it's on. [pause] Okay, that's better. Can you hear me clearer now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:49:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, a little clearer. Is there a good number if the crew has questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:49:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 401-555-0199."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:49:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0199. Okay, I've got that down. The replacement gets dropped off, usually within a week or two, depending on how busy they are. You don't need to be home. Just leave the old one at the curb if it's cracked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:50:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, so I leave the cracked one out? Okay. Or wait, should I keep it until the new one shows up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:50:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Keep it until the new one arrives, use it for now. If the crew wants to swap it, they'll pick up the old one then. Just put it out empty of bags next pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:50:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, loose items, no bags. Got it. Hmm, is there anything else I need to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:50:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's everything. The request is in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:50:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, great. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:50:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:50:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
